    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> A 60-ft-long, 10-ft-wide line of wind blasts from you while you concentrate. Each creature in it makes a STR save or is pushed 15 ft away from you; a creature that ends its turn in the line makes the save again. Moving toward you through it costs double. As a Bonus Action you can change its direction (place the area again).</p>",
